  "caveats": "This project data is collected on an informal basis from project managers. As such, this information may be out of date, and humanitarian energy projects outside the knowledge of the SAFE Humanitarian Working Group are not represented. If you have a question about a specific project and would like more information, please email info@safefuelandenergy.org. If you would like to improve this map by adding an energy project in a humanitarian setting, please visit: http://www.safefuelandenergy.org/where-we-work/add.cfm ",
